The `adhd` skill in this directory adapts substantial portions of the ADHD skill by
Udit Akhourii — https://github.com/UditAkhourii/adhd — which is distributed under the
MIT License. Its copyright and permission notice is retained below, as MIT requires.

This notice covers the vendored method only (the two-phase diverge/focus loop, the
general frame table, the pre-flight gate, and the anti-patterns list). FSD-specific
additions — the four FSD frames, the two entry contexts, the switch test, and the
routed-findings contract — are part of this repository and carry its own LICENSE.

